  "semanticRulesBeyondFieldSchema": [
    "Reject Python bool-as-int at runtime; require exact builtin types before comparisons. ClosedJSONschema alone isnotimplementation.",
    "Require exact contractreported44/SHA6ca8... andorig124/SHA246e..., not merelyvalidshape. ExactdigestANDbytecount; origrawliteralAPP stillrequired inmemory. RoleOTHERneveridentity.",
    "Require exactseven pathkeys/hashes andactualexecutablemodes; noaliases/eighthopaque path/rootauthoredmodes. Fullwitnessmetadata sameconsumedFD; allphysicalprocess checksindependent.",
    "Requestedlaunch/source/owner pins andclientPID/start/argv image samples must actuallybindsamereviewedinvocation; Booleanmarkers cannotserveasactualevidence.",
    "Historicalactor classes retainactualstatuses independently; successfulsetup exact0, failedclientouter1, utilitydirectwait0, externaltool0/foreground0 notdirectwait. Null remainsunknown.",
    "Fieldshape changes requiresynchronizedallreaders/history/receipts/controls; oldsource04reportedphysicalobjects cannotparse asnewtypedselfText.",
    "Allreadonly/externalfirstread/rawSHA/SAMEbufferchecks andallphase/archive/cap/history predicates remainrequired. Invalid,partial,missingorunknown -> HOLD."
  ],
  "noRuntimeImplementationOrAuthority": true
